+/**
+ * Meta operations.  Some GL operations can be expressed in terms of
+ * other GL operations.  For example, glBlitFramebuffer() can be done
+ * with texture mapping and glClear() can be done with polygon rendering.
+ *
+ * \author Brian Paul
+ */
+
+
